SUMMARY:Bach Cantata Series: Odes & Oratorios
LOCATION:Duke Chapel\, Durham
DESCRIPTION:In this concert\, two of J. S. Bach's most intimate solo cantat
 as-"Ich bin vergnügt mit meinem Glücke\," BWV 84\, and "Vergnügte Ruh\,
  beliebte Seelenlust\," BWV 170-explore themes of contentment\, contemplat
 ion\, and spiritual reflection. Selections from Handel's exquisite Italian
  chamber duets\, later transformed into "Messiah\," offer a fascinating gl
 impse into the composer's creative process and the journey from private mu
 sic-making to public masterpiece.\n\nFree admission. Paid parking is avail
 able at | Source: Duke University Events -- Concert/Music | Cost: free
