DESCRIPTION:Want to do more with AI? Agents can help. AI agents are designe
 d to work toward specific goals and complete tasks with less step-by-step 
 direction from the user. While they can be powerful and efficient tools\, 
 giving them too much autonomy can also create problems. In this workshop\,
  you’ll learn what AI agents can do\, where their limits are\, and how t
 o create and use your own using the UNC Library’s PromptLab. No prior ex
 perience with agents is required\, though participants who are new to gene
 ra | Source: UNC Chapel Hill Events Calendar (university-wide) | Cost: unk
 nown
URL:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/agentic-ai-8711
END:VEVENT
