UID:2026-11-09-genai-tools-and-resources-in-the-clinical-setting@date-plann
 ing-vault
DTSTAMP:20260927T000014Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261109T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261109T130000
SUMMARY:GenAI Tools and Resources in the Clinical Setting
LOCATION:Chapel Hill
DESCRIPTION:Curious about how to use generative AI (genAI) to inform your c
 linical research and practice?\n\n \n\nThis session will cover the basics 
 of using genAI chatbots and AI-assisted tools for clinical information ret
 rieval and literature reviews. We’ll discuss the pros and cons of using 
 AI tools for different steps of the research process\, prompting strategie
 s\, and using GenAI for evidence reviews. A review of clinical genAI tools
  will be included.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the UNC Health Scie
